# Allow-list: the build context holds only what the Dockerfile COPYs or bind-mounts, so .git, the local
# virtualenvs, caches, tests, and docs never reach the daemon and cannot invalidate a layer.
# Add a `!path` line whenever the Dockerfile gains a COPY.
*
!openapi.yaml
!server/pyproject.toml
!server/uv.lock
!server/README.md
!server/src
!server/alembic
!server/alembic.ini
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
